 gran_size: 64K 	chunk_size: 512K 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
 gran_size: 64K 	chunk_size: 1M 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
 gran_size: 64K 	chunk_size: 2M 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
 gran_size: 64K 	chunk_size: 4M 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
[...]
 gran_size: 512M 	chunk_size: 2G 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
 gran_size: 1G 	chunk_size: 1G 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
 gran_size: 1G 	chunk_size: 2G 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
 gran_size: 2G 	chunk_size: 2G 	num_reg: 0  	lose cover RAM: 511M
mtrr_cleanup: can not find optimal value
please specify mtrr_gran_size/mtrr_chunk_size

config and full dmesg are below.  I can bisect it some time but probably 
not before tomorrow.

